<title>UK: CRICKET-SCOTLAND V AUSTRALIA MATCH ABANDONED DUE TO RAIN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SCOTLAND V AUSTRALIA MATCH ABANDONED DUE TO RAIN.</headline>
<dateline>EDINBURGH 1997-07-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The one-day (50 overs) cricket match between Scotland and Australia was abandoned on Saturday due to rain.</p>
<p>Scores: Australia 278-9 innings closed (M.Slater 95; K.Sheridan 5-65). Scotland 95-6 in 21.5 overs.</p>
